sVThis Privacy Policy describes how and when Zentertain collects, uses, and shares your information when you use Zentertain, including our mobile applications and websites (the "Services").
p17
I1
sVWe may use and store information about your location to provide features of our Services, such as tagging a video with a location, and to improve and customize the Services, for example, with Content that has been tagged near your location.
